# `use` renames what it reaches with `as` (Jimmy, 13 November, ruling OS: "Use can support
# as"): `Birds` and `Fish` both declare `Kind` and `Count`; this file reaches `Birds`'s
# by their own names and `Fish`'s `Count` as `FishCount`, so no bare name collides.
# Written by Claude on the claude-self-hosting branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
mod Birds
mod Fish
test mod Tests
use Birds.*
use Fish.Count as FishCount
use Fish.Kind as FishKind
use Prelude.Upper as Shout

@page: @unit
@page:
    Ui.Label($text=$"{Count Small} {FishCount Fish.Huge} {Shout "x"}")                  # 0
